From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 21:59:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 74/83] cix: fix 6.6->7.2 API drift in
 clk/soc/phy/thermal/firmware

- clk_ops.round_rate removed: convert to determine_rate (acpi_clk, audss)
- platform_driver.remove returns void
- gpio_chip.set returns int
- struct cma multi-range layout (acpi_resource_lookup)
- strncpy removed -> strscpy; asm/unaligned.h -> linux/unaligned.h
- scmi perf device_domain_id dropped: local clocks-phandle helper
- guard vendor SMMU attach-notifier + dfx hisysevent (not ported)
---
 drivers/clk/cix/acpi_clk.c                  | 13 +++++----
 drivers/clk/cix/clk-sky1-audss.c            | 29 +-------------------
 drivers/phy/cix/phy-cix-usb2.c              |  2 ++
 drivers/soc/cix/acpi/acpi_resource_lookup.c |  7 ++++-
 drivers/soc/cix/acpi/cix-acpi-ec-gpio.c     |  4 +--
 drivers/soc/cix/acpi/cix-acpi-ec.c          |  4 +--
 drivers/soc/cix/acpi/dsdt_override.c        |  2 +-
 drivers/soc/cix/cix-ddr-lp.c                |  3 +--
 drivers/soc/cix/cix-plat.c                  |  6 +++++
 drivers/soc/cix/cix-suspend.c               | 11 ++++++--
 drivers/thermal/cix/cix_scmi_em.c           | 20 +++++++++++++-
 include/linux/cix/cix_scmi_em.h             | 30 +++++++++++++++++++++
 12 files changed, 84 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 include/linux/cix/cix_scmi_em.h

